y130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8","terminals":[{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-353df4da271bcc2b","name":"D"},{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-353df3da271bca78","name":"G"},{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-353df6da271bcf91","name":"S"},{"direction":"passive","id":"external-subcircuit-terminal-353df5da271bcdde","name":"B"}]}],"simulationFolders":[],"source":{"dialect":"spice3f5-core","entry":"submitted.spice","files":[{"content":{"encoding":"utf-8","text":".subckt DUT VIN VOUT VSS VREF\n* Large PMOS pass device\nXMP VOUT VG VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=60 l=0.25\nRPU VIN VG 50meg\n\n* Half-scale output feedback, high resistance to limit minimum-load overhead\nRFB1 VOUT VFB 10meg\nRFB2 VFB VSS 10meg\nRBLEED VOUT VSS 3.3meg\n\n* NMOS differential pair: low VFB pulls VG down and increases pass current\nXMNR VG VREF TAIL VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=10 l=2\nXMNF VD VFB TAIL VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=10 l=2\n\n* PMOS current-mirror load\nXMPD VD VD VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=1 l=2\nXMPM VG VD VIN VIN sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 w=1 l=2\n\n* Resistor-set, mirrored tail bias\nRBIAS VIN BIAS 4.4meg\nXMB BIAS BIAS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=2 l=1\nXMT TAIL BIAS VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 w=9 l=1\n\n* Miller compensation with a series zero\nRCOMP VG VC 10k\nCCOMP VC VOUT 2p\n.ends DUT\n"},"hash":"sha256:1bc89b85366696b7bbec1df0de61018c6f3c22ae86cc9b221a22f96ad690b041","id":"source-c64c2f6b688cd548","path":"submitted.spice"}],"sourcePolicy":"copy"},"symbolLibrary":{"hash":"razavi-reference-v1","id":"razavi-symbols","version":"1"},"structureRevision":0}
